|rowspan=2|''Riften has earned quite a sinister reputation, mainly due to the Thieves Guild's presence in the [[Skyrim:The_Ratway|sewers]] beneath the streets.''||Clutter\GrayFox\{{zwsp}}GrayFox.nif||[[File:SR-load-Riften has earned quite a sinister reputation (bust).jpg|96px]]||rowspan=2| In Riften, 6% chance, [[Skyrim:Blindsighted|Blindsighted]] completed.
